{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t國家主席習近平下午，在深圳會見來華出席亞太經合組織領導人非正式會議的美國總統特朗普。<br/>\n<br/>\n央視新聞報道，會見持續約1小時。活動結束後，特朗普到休息室。<br/>\n<br/>\n外電較早時報道，習近平在會面中表示，願與特朗普合作，持續引領中美關係走在正確的軌道上，又形容中美關係整體穩定並持續改善。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：羅宇光\t\t</p>\n<ul><li>主頁</li></ul></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T07:04:09.528614+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T06:41:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T06:57:22.328088+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T06:57:22.328088+00:00","content_hash":"693f331dccd235ef1ac65068576b0420c5ae1b8a252e7602e130c2f7ef4377b7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}